<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170654953465" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Gawe Wujud Aljabar Luwih Prasaja nganggo Urutan Ngetung</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655225397"><term id="term-00015">Nggawe wujud aljabar luwih prasaja</term> tegese nindakake kabeh petungan sing bisa ditindakake. Tuladhane, kanggo nggawe luwih prasaja <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>, luwih dhisik kita ngepingake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nganti oleh 8, banjur ditambahi 1 dadi 9. Biasakna nulis langkah petungan mudhun ing kaca. Saben langkah ditulis ing ngisor langkah sadurunge. Tuladha mau yen ditulis dadi kaya ngene:</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170655083428" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170654905788">Kanthi ora nganggo <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00016">tandha padha karo</term> nalika nggawe wujud aljabar luwih prasaja, kowe bisa nyingkiri kliru antarane wujud aljabar lan persamaan.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170654905792">
<title>Nggawe Wujud Aljabar Luwih Prasaja</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655107395">Kanggo <emphasis effect="bold">nggawe wujud aljabar luwih prasaja</emphasis>, tindakna kabeh operasi ing wujud kuwi.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655351594">Umume tandha lan tulisan sing dienggo ing aljabar wis dikenalake, nanging saiki kudu dijlentrehake urutan ngetunge. Yen ora ana urutan sing baku, wujud aljabar bisa ditegesi kanthi cara beda lan asile beda. Tuladhane, delengen wujud iki:</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170655125718" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170654942450">Yen wujud iki kokgawe luwih prasaja, asile pira?</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654942453">Ana siswa sing kandha 49,</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170655178023" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mspace width="0.8em"/><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Amarga</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>ngasilake</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mspace width="0.8em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>yaiku</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>49</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mspace width="0.8em"/><m:mn>49</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170654906230">Siswa liyane kandha 25,</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170654906233" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Amarga</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>yaiku</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>ngasilake</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170655150670">Bayangna kaya apa kacaune sistem perbankan kita yen saben soal duwe wangsulan bener sing beda-beda!</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655150674">Wujud aljabar sing padha kudu ngasilake nilai sing padha. Mula, wiwit biyen para ahli matematika nggawe pedoman sing jenenge <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00017">urutan ngetung</term>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170654985585" class="howto">
<title>Tindakna operasi manut urutane.</title>
<list id="fs-id1166422648602" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise">
<item>Kurung lan Tandha Panglumpukan Liyane
<list id="fs-id1170655082463" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Gawe kabeh wujud aljabar ing njero kurung utawa tandha panglumpukan liyane dadi luwih prasaja, wiwit saka kurung paling njero.</item>
</list></item>
<item>Eksponen
<list id="fs-id1170654914692" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Gawe kabeh wujud aljabar sing nganggo eksponen dadi luwih prasaja.</item>
</list></item>
<item>Ping-pingan lan Paran
<list id="fs-id1170655178958" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Tindakna kabeh ping-pingan lan paran kanthi urut saka kiwa menyang tengen. Operasi loro iki prioritase padha.</item>
</list></item>
<item>Panambahan lan <emphasis effect="bold">Pangurangan</emphasis>
<list id="fs-id1170654943796" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Tindakna kabeh panambahan lan pangurangan kanthi urut saka kiwa menyang tengen. Operasi loro iki prioritase padha.</item>
</list></item>
</list>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1166425080552" class="manipulative-math">Kagiyatan Matematika Manipulatif “Dolanan 24” menehi latihan nganggo urutan ngetung.</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654938531">Supaya eling urutane, klumpukna operasi dadi patang tataran prioritas iki. Operasi sing tatarane padha ditindakake saka kiwa menyang tengen.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170654007218" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">1.</m:mtext><m:mtext> Tandha panglumpukan</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">Prioritas</m:mtext><m:mtext> kapisan</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">2.</m:mtext><m:mtext> Eksponen</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">Prioritas</m:mtext><m:mtext> kapindho</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">3.</m:mtext><m:mtext> Ping-pingan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">lan</m:mtext><m:mtext> paran</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">Prioritas</m:mtext><m:mtext> padha</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">kiwa</m:mtext><m:mtext> menyang tengen</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">4.</m:mtext><m:mtext> Panambahan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">lan</m:mtext><m:mtext> pangurangan</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">Prioritas</m:mtext><m:mtext> padha</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext mathvariant="bold">kiwa</m:mtext><m:mtext> menyang tengen</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1170654932101"><emphasis effect="bold">Ping-pingan</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="bold">paran</emphasis> prioritase padha. Ora mesthi ping-pingan luwih dhisik tinimbang paran, utawa paran luwih dhisik tinimbang ping-pingan; loro-lorone ditindakake kanthi urut saka <emphasis effect="bold">kiwa</emphasis> menyang <emphasis effect="bold">tengen</emphasis>.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654914381"><emphasis effect="bold">Panambahan</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="bold">pangurangan</emphasis> uga prioritase padha. Loro-lorone ditindakake kanthi urut saka <emphasis effect="bold">kiwa</emphasis> menyang <emphasis effect="bold">tengen</emphasis>.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654928166">Ayo nyoba tuladha.</para>
<example id="fs-id1170654928169">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654954598">
<problem id="fs-id1170654954600">
<para id="fs-id1170654954602">Gawe luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654939340">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id1167836283034"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <newline/>
<table id="fs-id1167833022118" class="unnumbered unstyled can-break" aria-label="Gambar iki ana rong kolom, teks ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ing larik kapisan kolom tengen ana wujud 4 ditambah 3 ping 7. Siji larik ing ngisore, tulisan ing kiwa unine: “Apa ana kurung? Ora. Apa ana eksponen? Ora. Apa ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.” Tembung “kurung”, “eksponen”, “ping-pingan”, lan “paran” dicithak kandel kanggo nandhani jinis operasi sing dipriksa. Siji larik ing ngisore, tulisan ing kiwa unine “Pingna luwih dhisik.” Ing tengen ana maneh wujud 4 ditambah 3 ping 7, sing 3 ping 7 wernane abang. Siji larik ing ngisore, tulisan ing kiwa unine “Gunggungen.” Ing tengen ana wujud 4 ditambah 21. Ing ngisore ana 25, yaiku gunggung 4 lan 21."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry/>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836282522" alt="Ana wujud matematika 4+3•7 kanthi tulisan ireng ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_005a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis effect="bold">kurung</emphasis>? Ora.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis effect="bold">eksponen</emphasis>? Ora.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis effect="bold">ping-pingan</emphasis> utawa <emphasis effect="bold">paran</emphasis>? Ya.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna luwih dhisik.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836477496" alt="Ana wujud matematika '4+3•7' ing latar putih. Angka 4 lan tandha tambah wernane ireng, nanging angka 3, titik ping-pingan, lan angka 7 wernane abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_005b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gunggungen.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167833397265" alt="Gambar iki nuduhake wujud matematika prasaja '4+21', tulisane ireng ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_005c_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry/>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836477509" alt="Angka 25 ditampilake nganggo tulisan klawu peteng ing latar putih polos."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_005d_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</para>
<para id="fs-id1167836522115"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <newline/>
<table id="fs-id1167829713618" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar iki ana rong kolom tanpa judhul kolom: tulisan ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ana enem larik. Larik kapisan: kiwa kosong; tengen bukak kurung biasa, 4 ditambah 3, tutup kurung biasa, ping 7. Larik kapindho: kiwa “Apa ana kurung? Ya.”; tengen wujud sing padha, bukak kurung biasa, 4 ditambah 3, tutup kurung biasa, ping 7. Larik katelu: kiwa “Gawe bagean ing njero kurung luwih prasaja.”; tengen bukak kurung biasa, 7, tutup kurung biasa, ping 7. Ping-pingan ing larik iki dituduhake saka jejerane, tanpa titik sing dicithak. Larik kapapat: kiwa “Apa ana eksponen? Ora.”; tengen kosong. Larik kalima: kiwa “Apa ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.”; tengen kosong. Larik kapenem: kiwa “Pingna.”; tengen 49. Tembung jinis operasi ing pitakon dicithak kandel. Wacan iki nerangake petungan tanpa gumantung warna."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry/>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836700561" alt="Wujud matematika nuduhake gunggung 4 lan 3 ing njero kurung sing dipingake karo 7. Wujude ditulis (4 + 3)·7."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_006a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis effect="bold">kurung</emphasis>? Ya.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167824617198" alt="Wujud matematika nuduhake (4+3) dipingake karo 7. Kabeh bagean (4+3), kalebu kurung lan tandha tambah, wernane abang; titik ping-pingan lan angka 7 wernane peteng."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_006b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gawe bagean ing njero kurung luwih prasaja.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836329648" alt="Ana wujud (7)7 tanpa titik ping-pingan. Angka 7 sing kapisan ana ing njero kurung lan wernane abang; kurung lan angka 7 sing kapindho wernane peteng. (7) sing jejer karo 7 tegese dipingake."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_006c_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis effect="bold">eksponen</emphasis>? Ora.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis effect="bold">ping-pingan</emphasis> utawa <emphasis effect="bold">paran</emphasis>? Ya.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167829808043" alt="Angka '49' katon cetha ing latar putih polos, nganggo tulisan klawu peteng utawa ireng sing rada burem."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_006d_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654944310" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654936731">
<problem id="fs-id1170654936733">
<para id="fs-id1170654936735">Gawe luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654942949">
<para id="fs-id1170654942951"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 2 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 14</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654941665" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655164725">
<problem id="fs-id1170655164727">
<para id="fs-id1170655164730">Gawe luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655213403">
<para id="fs-id1170654966589"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 35 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 99</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1170654942986">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654942988">
<problem id="fs-id1170654942990">
<para id="fs-id1170654944773">Gawe luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655114295">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="fs-id1167836375645" class="unnumbered unstyled can-break" aria-label="Gambar iki ana rong kolom tanpa judhul kolom: tulisan ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ana wolung larik. Larik kapisan: kiwa “Kurung? Ya, kurangi luwih dhisik.”; tengen 18 dipara 6 ditambah 4 ping bukak kurung biasa, 5 dikurangi 2, tutup kurung biasa. Ing ngisore ing sel sing padha ana 18 dipara 6 ditambah 4 ping bukak kurung biasa, 3, tutup kurung biasa. Larik kapindho: kiwa “Eksponen? Ora.”; tengen kosong. Larik katelu: kiwa “Ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.”; tengen 18 dipara 6 ditambah 4 ping bukak kurung biasa, 3, tutup kurung biasa. Larik kapapat: kiwa “Para luwih dhisik amarga ping-pingan lan paran ditindakake saka kiwa menyang tengen.”; tengen 3 ditambah 4 ping bukak kurung biasa, 3, tutup kurung biasa. Larik kalima: kiwa “Isih ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.”; tengen kosong. Larik kapenem: kiwa “Pingna.”; tengen 3 ditambah 12. Larik kapitu: kiwa “Isih ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ora.”; tengen kosong. Larik kawolu: kiwa “Ana panambahan utawa pangurangan? Ya.”; tengen 15. Wilangan sing jejer karo kurung tegese dipingake. Wacan iki nerangake petungan tanpa gumantung warna."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry align="left" valign="top">Kurung? Ya, kurangi luwih dhisik.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math><newline/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em"/></m:mrow></m:math><media id="fs-id1167836598935" alt="Wujud matematika nuduhake 18 dipara 6, ditambah 4 dipingake karo 3, yaiku 18 ÷ 6 + 4(3)."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_007b_img.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Eksponen? Ora.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1171791418206" alt="Ana wujud matematika 18 ÷ 6 + 4(3) ing latar putih kanggo nuduhake urutan ngetung. Bagean paran lan ping-pingan wernane abang, nanging tandha tambah ing antarane wernane peteng."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_007f_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Para luwih dhisik amarga ping-pingan lan paran ditindakake saka kiwa menyang tengen.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167833349691" alt="Ana wujud matematika '3 + 4(3)', bagean '4(3)' diwenehi warna abang kanggo nuduhake yen ping-pingan ditindakake sadurunge panambahan manut urutan ngetung."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_007c_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Isih ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836622811" alt="Ana wujud matematika prasaja '3 + 12' nganggo tulisan peteng sing cetha ing latar putih, minangka soal panambahan."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_007d_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Isih ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ora.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Ana panambahan utawa pangurangan? Ya.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167829596718" alt="Angka '15' ditampilake nganggo warna klawu peteng ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_007e_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655128975" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655117790">
<problem id="fs-id1170655117792">
<para id="fs-id1170655117794">Gawe luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654943705">
<para id="fs-id1170654936134">16</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654928200" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654928204">
<problem id="fs-id1170655232374">
<para id="fs-id1170655232376">Gawe luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655288151">
<para id="fs-id1170655288153">23</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654928809">Yen ana sawetara tandha panglumpukan, kita nggawe bagean ing kurung paling njero luwih prasaja dhisik, banjur maju menyang njaba.</para>
<example id="fs-id1170655174684">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655174686">
<problem id="fs-id1170655228886">
<para id="fs-id1170655228888">Gawe luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654914329">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="fs-id1167829840981" class="unnumbered unstyled can-break" aria-label="Gambar iki ana rong kolom tanpa judhul kolom: tulisan ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ana patbelas larik. Larik kapisan: kiwa kosong; tengen 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 6 dikurangi 3 ping bukak kurung biasa, 4 dikurangi 2, tutup kurung biasa, tutup kurung siku. Larik kapindho: kiwa “Apa ana kurung (utawa tandha panglumpukan liyane)? Ya.”; tengen kosong. Larik katelu: kiwa “Gatekna kurung biasa ing njero kurung siku.”; tengen wujud wiwitan dibaleni: 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 6 dikurangi 3 ping bukak kurung biasa, 4 dikurangi 2, tutup kurung biasa, tutup kurung siku. Larik kapapat: kiwa “Kurangi.”; tengen 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 6 dikurangi 3 ping bukak kurung biasa, 2, tutup kurung biasa, tutup kurung siku. Larik kalima: kiwa “Terusna ing njero kurung siku lan pingna.”; tengen 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 6 dikurangi 6, tutup kurung siku. Larik kapenem: kiwa “Terusna ing njero kurung siku lan kurangi.”; tengen 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 0, tutup kurung siku. Larik kapitu: kiwa “Wujud aljabar ing njero kurung siku ora perlu digawe luwih prasaja maneh.”; tengen kosong. Larik kawolu: kiwa “Apa ana eksponen? Ya.”; tengen 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 0, tutup kurung siku. Larik kasanga: kiwa “Gawe wujud pangkat luwih prasaja.”; tengen 5 ditambah 8 ditambah 3 ping bukak kurung siku, 0, tutup kurung siku. Larik kasepuluh: kiwa “Apa ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.”; tengen kosong. Larik kasewelas: kiwa “Pingna.”; tengen 5 ditambah 8 ditambah 0. Larik karolas: kiwa “Apa ana panambahan utawa pangurangan? Ya.”; tengen kosong. Larik katelulas: kiwa “Gunggungen.”; tengen 13 ditambah 0. Larik kapatbelas: kiwa “Gunggungen.”; tengen 13. Wilangan sing jejer karo kurung tegese dipingake. Wacan iki nerangake petungan tanpa gumantung warna."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry/>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836287043" alt="Ana wujud matematika kanthi wilangan lan operasi panambahan, pangurangan, pangkat, lan ping-pingan sing ditata nganggo kurung biasa lan siku: 5 + 2^3 + 3[6 - 3(4 - 2)]."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana kurung (utawa tandha panglumpukan liyane)? Ya.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gatekna kurung biasa ing njero kurung siku.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836326514" alt="Soal matematika nuduhake wujud petungan 5 + 2^3 + 3[6 - 3(4 - 2)]. Pangurangan ing kurung paling njero, '4 - 2', diwenehi warna abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kurangi.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836578693" alt="Wujud matematika unine 5 + 2^3 + 3[6 - 3(2)]. Bagean '3(2)' diwenehi warna abang kanggo nuduhake langkah sing lagi ditindakake."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008c_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Terusna ing njero kurung siku lan pingna.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167833142573" alt="Wujud matematika nuduhake 5 ditambah 2 kubik ditambah 3 dipingake karo besaran 6 dikurangi 6, lan angka 6 kapindho diwenehi warna abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008d_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Terusna ing njero kurung siku lan kurangi.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167824720931" alt="Wujud matematika nuduhake '5 + 2^3 + 3[0]'. Angka 0 ing njero kurung siku diwenehi warna abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008e_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Wujud aljabar ing njero kurung siku ora perlu digawe luwih prasaja maneh.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana eksponen? Ya.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836571320" alt="Wujud matematika nuduhake 5 ditambah 2 pangkat 3, ditambah 3 dipingake karo 0."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008f_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gawe wujud pangkat luwih prasaja.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836363366" alt="Ana wujud matematika '5 + 8 + 3[0]' ing latar putih. Bagean '3[0]' diwenehi warna abang kanggo nuduhake bagean sing lagi ditindakake."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008g_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana ping-pingan utawa paran? Ya.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836628989" alt="Gambar nuduhake wujud matematika 5+8+0. Angka 5 lan 8 karo tandha tambah kapisan wernane abang, nanging tandha tambah kapindho lan angka 0 wernane ireng."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008h_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana panambahan utawa pangurangan? Ya.</entry>
    <entry/>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gunggungen.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836408301" alt="Ana wujud matematika '13 + 0', tulisane abang rada burem ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008i_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gunggungen.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836321064" alt="13"><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_008j_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655222643" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655222647">
<problem id="fs-id1170654924513">
<para id="fs-id1170654924515">Gawe luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655201328">
<para id="fs-id1170655201331">86</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654936028" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654942628">
<problem id="fs-id1170654942630">
<para id="fs-id1170654942632">Gawe luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655163264">
<para id="fs-id1170654940244">1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>